WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
In this video I'll show you how to log in to ApunteQuiz.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Click on the "Log in" button in the top right corner.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Now enter your credentials. Your email address. And your password. If you wish, you can check "Remember me" to keep your session active.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Click on "Log in". You will be redirected to your dashboard where you can see all your saved quizzes.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Done! You're now logged into your account. Thank you for using ApunteQuiz!

